{"id":73048,"date":"2026-11-07T20:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-11-07T20:37:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73048"},"modified":"2026-11-07T21:47:08","modified_gmt":"2026-11-07T20:47:08","slug":"koyu-games","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/koyu-games\/","title":{"rendered":"K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 &#8211; Winter (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua<\/strong>, em <strong>T\u00e1bua<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o de inverno combina resist\u00eancia aer\u00f3bica e for\u00e7a funcional num formato competitivo de simula\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Hyrox<\/strong> com partidas faseadas por grupos ao longo do dia e check-in na Call Room a partir das 08:00.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Beira Serra<\/strong>, numa vila banhada pelos vales dos rios <strong>Mondego<\/strong> e <strong>Seia<\/strong> e conhecida pela ic\u00f3nica <strong>Pedra da S\u00e9<\/strong>, colocas \u00e0 prova a tua capacidade f\u00edsica nos formatos <strong>Full<\/strong> (<strong>6,4 km<\/strong> em 8 segmentos de 800 m) e <strong>Half<\/strong> (<strong>3,2 km<\/strong> em 8 segmentos de 400 m), intercalados com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais: 1000 m SkiErg, 4x12,5 m Sled Push, 4x12,5 m Sled Pull, 4x20 m Burpee Broad Jump, 1000 m Row, 200 m Kettlebell Farmers Carry, 4x25 m Sandbag Walking Lunges e 100 Wall Balls. O programa integra ainda o desafio especial <strong>Doubles Firemen<\/strong> (<strong>2 km<\/strong> em 5x400 m com EPI urbano e 5 esta\u00e7\u00f5es operacionais: Fireman's Carry, Sled Push, Sled Pull, Jerrican Carry e FireHose Walking Lunges).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado conjuntamente pelo <strong>K\u00f6y\u00fc Fitness e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de T\u00e1bua<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de categorias individuais (<strong>Solo Men e Women<\/strong>), duplas (<strong>Doubles Men, Women, Mixed e Firemen<\/strong>) e estafetas de 4 elementos (<strong>Relay Men, Women e Mixed<\/strong>), com entrada gratuita para o p\u00fablico no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua. Descobre tamb\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/o-que-e-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">o que \u00e9 o HYROX<\/a> e consulta o calend\u00e1rio completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Provas HYROX<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua, T\u00e1bua, Coimbra<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(25