space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Solo Full (Men & Women)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Solo Half (Men & Women)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Doubles Full (Men, Women & Mixed)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Doubles Half (Men, Women & Mixed)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Relay Full (Men, Women & Mixed \u2013 4 Atletas)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Doubles Firemen (Fireman Challenge em EPI)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia 9 de janeiro de 2027, no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua (concelho de T\u00e1bua, distrito de Coimbra). O secretariado e Call Room funcionam entre as 08:00 e as 18:00, sendo a hora exata de partida de cada grupo (heat) comunicada via e-mail e\/ou SMS na semana anterior ao evento.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os formatos, dist\u00e2ncias e esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As categorias Solo e Doubles disputam-se nos formatos Full (8 segmentos de corrida de 800 m, totalizando 6,4 km) e Half (8 segmentos de 400 m, totalizando 3,2 km), intercalados com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es: 1000 m Ski, 4x12,5 m Sled Push, 4x12,5 m Sled Pull, 4x20 m Burpee Broad Jump, 1000 m Row, 200 m Kettlebell Farmers Carry, 4x25 m Walking Lunges e 100 Wall Balls. As estafetas (Relay de 4 atletas) realizam o formato Full (cada elemento cumpre 2 corridas e 2 esta\u00e7\u00f5es) e as Duplas de Bombeiros (Doubles Firemen) cumprem 5 segmentos de 400 m (2 km) com EPI urbano e 5 esta\u00e7\u00f5es operacionais.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as cargas regulamentares nos exerc\u00edcios principais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em Solo Men, Doubles Men, Doubles Mixed e Relay Men, o Sled Push tem 150 kg, Sled Pull 100 kg, Farmers Carry 2x24 kg, Walking Lunges com Sandbag de 20 kg e Wall Balls com bola de 6 kg (alvo a 3 m). Em Solo Women, Doubles Women e Relay Women, o Sled Push \u00e9 de 100 kg, Sled Pull 75 kg, Farmers Carry 2x16 kg, Sandbag de 10 kg e Wall Balls de 3 kg (alvo a 2,7 m). Em Doubles Firemen, usam-se 130 kg\/85 kg nos tren\u00f3s (80 kg\/60 kg em Firewomen), 2 Jerricans de 15 L (10 L em Firewomen) e mangueira FireHose de 10 kg.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">At\u00e9 quando decorrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e quais os requisitos de idade?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas online at\u00e9 ao dia 1 de janeiro de 2027 (n\u00e3o sendo aceites inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no dia do evento) para participantes entre os 14 e os 80 anos completos na data da prova. Os atletas devem efetuar o check-in no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua com pelo menos 60 minutos de anteced\u00eancia face \u00e0 sua hora de partida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e como funciona o acesso do p\u00fablico?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 organizada pelo K\u00f6y\u00fc Fitness e pelos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de T\u00e1bua (contactos oficiais: geral@koyu.pt e +351 927 386 014). A entrada para o p\u00fablico no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua \u00e9 100% gratuita.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-09\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-09\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"T\u00e1bua\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 \u2013 Winter (Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox) realiza-se a 9 de janeiro em T\u00e1bua. Participa em Solo, Doubles, Relay ou Bombeiros e garante j\u00e1 a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-koyu-games.webp\"], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"K\u00f6y\u00fc Fitness e Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de T\u00e1bua\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter (Hybrid \/ Simula\u00e7\u00e3o Hyrox)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O K\u00f6y\u00fc Games 2027 - Winter realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia 9 de janeiro de 2027, no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua (concelho de T\u00e1bua, distrito de Coimbra). O secretariado e Call Room funcionam entre as 08:00 e as 18:00, sendo a hora exata de partida de cada grupo (heat) comunicada via e-mail e\/ou SMS na semana anterior ao evento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os formatos, dist\u00e2ncias e esta\u00e7\u00f5es funcionais da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As categorias Solo e Doubles disputam-se nos formatos Full (8 segmentos de corrida de 800 m, totalizando 6,4 km) e Half (8 segmentos de 400 m, totalizando 3,2 km), intercalados com 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es: 1000 m Ski, 4x12,5 m Sled Push, 4x12,5 m Sled Pull, 4x20 m Burpee Broad Jump, 1000 m Row, 200 m Kettlebell Farmers Carry, 4x25 m Walking Lunges e 100 Wall Balls. As estafetas (Relay de 4 atletas) realizam o formato Full (cada elemento cumpre 2 corridas e 2 esta\u00e7\u00f5es) e as Duplas de Bombeiros (Doubles Firemen) cumprem 5 segmentos de 400 m (2 km) com EPI urbano e 5 esta\u00e7\u00f5es operacionais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as cargas regulamentares nos exerc\u00edcios principais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Em Solo Men, Doubles Men, Doubles Mixed e Relay Men, o Sled Push tem 150 kg, Sled Pull 100 kg, Farmers Carry 2x24 kg, Walking Lunges com Sandbag de 20 kg e Wall Balls com bola de 6 kg (alvo a 3 m). Em Solo Women, Doubles Women e Relay Women, o Sled Push \u00e9 de 100 kg, Sled Pull 75 kg, Farmers Carry 2x16 kg, Sandbag de 10 kg e Wall Balls de 3 kg (alvo a 2,7 m). Em Doubles Firemen, usam-se 130 kg\/85 kg nos tren\u00f3s (80 kg\/60 kg em Firewomen), 2 Jerricans de 15 L (10 L em Firewomen) e mangueira FireHose de 10 kg.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"At\u00e9 quando decorrem as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e quais os requisitos de idade?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas online at\u00e9 ao dia 1 de janeiro de 2027 (n\u00e3o sendo aceites inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no dia do evento) para participantes entre os 14 e os 80 anos completos na data da prova. Os atletas devem efetuar o check-in no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua com pelo menos 60 minutos de anteced\u00eancia face \u00e0 sua hora de partida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e como funciona o acesso do p\u00fablico?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A competi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 organizada pelo K\u00f6y\u00fc Fitness e pelos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de T\u00e1bua (contactos oficiais: geral@koyu.pt e +351 927 386 014). A entrada para o p\u00fablico no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de T\u00e1bua \u00e9 100% gratuita.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":73049,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[1455],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-73048","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-tabua-coimbra","event_type-hyrox","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-koyu-game